{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202623o2h64wkS1793266498.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在北京，外交部指，日本有人試圖透過文化產品挑動反華情緒。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆說：「這部電視劇再次暴露出，日本國內始終存在一股勢力，企圖通過文化產品醜化、抹黑中國，散播仇華情緒，應當引起國際社會和日本國內有識之士的警惕。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:46.932330+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:58:10.088255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:21.983166+00:00","content_hash":"0a5946db1011ab98dc3241e9d5bd983194a1e88bd680b015b789b91db023734f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:46.932330+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}